text DiglettsCave_SouthEntrance_Text_KeepGoingLeft {
    "I'm stuck, I can't figure out how to\n"
    "traverse this floor.\p"
    "If you're lost, keep going left and\n"
    "you'll come back here eventually.\l"
    "That much, I was able to find out."
}

text DiglettsCave_SouthEntrance_Text_GruntIntroM {
    "Are you lost in these woods?\n"
    "I'm going to make your life\l"
    "even harder!"
}

text DiglettsCave_SouthEntrance_Text_GruntDefeatedM {
    "I don't need to say anything.\n"
    "My work here is done!"
}

text DiglettsCave_SouthEntrance_ThePuzzlesAreClues {
    "The puzzles on the wall are clues.\n"
    "That's all I'm going to say."
}

text DiglettsCave_SouthEntrance_Text_GruntIntroF {
    "Still confused?\n"
    "Then perhaps this will enlighten you!"
}

text DiglettsCave_SouthEntrance_Text_GruntDefeatedF {
    "…"
}

text DiglettsCave_SouthEntrance_Text_RememberToGoLeft {
    "Remember to keep going left\n"
    "if you want to give up and return\l"
    "to the exit downstairs."
}
